Package: ootar
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Traversal-resistant archive manager with zero zip-slip vulnerability
 A traversal-resistant archive manager (USTAR/tar) written in pure openOODA, featuring
 zero-trust path sanitization against zip-slip exploits, capability-gated safe extraction,
 themed table of contents listing via oote palettes, and an MCP stdio surface.
